And Jenna-
还有珍娜——

1110
00:51:35.580 --> 00:51:41.720
Well, the funny thing, Angela, is I think you would throw the margarita karaoke party.
嗯，有趣的是，安吉拉，我觉得你会办那种玛格丽特卡拉OK派对。

1111
00:51:41.860 --> 00:51:45.220
