Dwight does that classic Dwight thing, though, of while someone else is maybe hurting or trying to forget about something, he thinks he's helping, but he's just like, wow,
不过德怀特又做了那种典型的德怀特式举动，当别人可能正处于伤痛中或试图忘记某事时，他以为自己在帮忙，但他却说，哇，

