1146
00:53:47.500 --> 00:53:47.600
Right.
没错。

1147
00:53:47.700 --> 00:53:52.660
If this woman came into the office, this is how I would behave, and that's how I'm going to behave.
如果这个女人来到办公室，我会怎么表现，那我就要那样表现。

1148
00:53:52.920 --> 00:53:53.160
Yeah.
是啊。

1149
00:53:53.300 --> 00:53:55.320
I think Pam is trying to be a grownup, too.
我觉得帕姆也在努力变得成熟。

1150
