起初，约翰·梅尔说，我觉得不行。

2155
01:48:32.410 --> 01:48:32.630
What?
什么？

2156
01:48:33.250 --> 01:48:35.710
He told his friend, uh-uh, not happening?
他告诉朋友，呃，不行，没门？

2157
01:48:36.730 --> 01:48:38.270
He was like, I don't think so.
他说，我觉得不行。

2158
01:48:38.350 --> 01:48:40.750
And he actually wrote about this on his blog.
他还在博客上写过这件事。

2159
01:48:41.230 --> 01:48:46.390
He was like, one of my favorite shows on television, The Office, wanted to use my song,
他说，我最喜欢的电视节目之一《办公室》想用我的歌，

2160
01:48:46.490 --> 01:48:49.490
Your Body is a Wonderland, in a scene for their Christmas episode.
《Your Body is a Wonderland》，用在他们圣诞特辑的一个场景里。

2161
01:48:50.170 --> 01:48:55.150
And he was like, now, I'm not making apologies for my work, but it's safe to say I don't get
他说，我不是要为自己的作品道歉，但可以肯定的是，

2162
