asked to use Wonderland for strongman competitions and documentaries about aircraft carriers.
没人会找我用这首歌去配大力士比赛或者航空母舰纪录片。

2163
01:48:59.930 --> 01:49:03.470
I usually get asked so that people can goof on it.
找我用这首歌通常都是为了拿它开涮。

2164
01:49:03.610 --> 01:49:06.310
So I initially turned down the requeSt.
所以我起初拒绝了这个请求。

2165
01:49:07.450 --> 01:49:12.990
But after thinking about it, I decided to go for it, but with one stipulation.
但后来想了想，我决定答应，但有一个条件。

