嗯，这是我的故事。

2286
01:54:58.000 --> 01:55:01.780
I was terrified to sing this song in front of everyone.
我在大家面前唱这首歌时非常害怕。

2287
01:55:01.780 --> 01:55:04.960
I do not like singing in front of people.
我不喜欢在别人面前唱歌。

2288
01:55:05.020 --> 01:55:08.020
I just am not comfortable singing in front of people.
在别人面前唱歌让我很不自在。

2289
01:55:08.180 --> 01:55:12.440
