我跟雷恩说了我有多害怕。

2308
01:56:23.710 --> 01:56:28.010
You know, we did a take or two where the microphone was on a stand, you know?
你知道，我们拍了一两遍，当时麦克风是在支架上的，你知道吧？

2309
01:56:28.510 --> 01:56:34.610
And I'm standing holding my hands, like in this very sort of like, I don't know, I'm clutching my hands.
我当时站着，双手紧握，就像这样，我不知道，我紧紧攥着手。

2310
01:56:34.930 --> 01:56:35.130
Very prim and proper.
非常拘谨端庄。

2311
01:56:35.270 --> 01:56:38.010
Very prim and proper, clutching my hands in front of my cheSt.
非常拘谨端庄，双手在胸前紧紧攥着。

2312
01:56:38.190 --> 01:56:40.730
This was an idea that Jen had, you know?
这是简出的主意，你知道吗？

2313
01:56:40.850 --> 01:56:48.210
And so I'm standing like this because she was saying that she thought I should look like I'm in a very serious church choir stance or something, you know?
我之所以那样站着，是因为她说她觉得我应该看起来像是在唱那种非常严肃的唱诗班，或者类似的样子，你懂吗？

2314
01:56:48.830 --> 01:56:49.230
Okay.
好的。

2315
01:56:49.230 --> 01:56:52.970
