所以我那样站着，伙计们，我当时太紧张了。

2316
01:56:52.970 --> 01:56:57.490
I was digging my fingernails into the skin of my other hand.
我把指甲都掐进另一只手的手心里了。

2317
01:56:57.650 --> 01:57:03.070
I had marks on my hands where I was just like, like death gripping myself.
我手上都有印子，因为我当时就像是，像是死死地掐着自己。

2318
01:57:03.770 --> 01:57:06.630
And after the first take, I showed Rain my hands.
第一遍拍完后，我给雷恩看了我的手。

2319
01:57:06.770 --> 01:57:08.150
I was like, look what I'm doing.
我说，你看我做了什么。

2320
01:57:08.250 --> 01:57:09.030
I'm so nervous.
我太紧张了。

2321
01:57:09.530 --> 01:57:15.870
And Rain, you know, listen, he just came through for me, you guys.
而雷恩，你知道，听着，他真的帮了我大忙，伙计们。

2322
01:57:16.210 --> 01:57:17.910
Just came through for me.
